    "detailed_description": "Delivery personnel headed to a condominium building to deliver a package.<br>The delivery personnel completes the delivery but realizes he cannot leave the condominium building. As he explores the building, he finds out shocking truths.<br><br>This is an exploratory, third-person horror game.<br>There are four endings.<br><br><strong>Playtime</strong><br>30 to 90 minutes<br><br><strong>Save</strong><br>The content will be saved automatically.<br><br><strong>Low-load setting</strong><br>Settings for low-load gaming are available to allow you to play on computers that do not meet the recommended specifications.<br><br>This game was developed using Unreal Engine 5.<br>It is recommended that you update your graphics card to the latest version whenever possible.<br><br><u>Whether you are an individual or a corporation, you are allowed to play the game live, stream it, or gain profit in conjunction therewith.</u>",
